00:53:43.839 --> 00:53:50.140
for that is that all things considered, symmetrical
people are more healthy than asymmetrical

00:53:50.140 --> 00:53:51.140
people.

00:53:51.140 --> 00:53:55.320
Asymmetry indicates taht somethings gone wrong
