00:55:00.390 --> 00:55:01.390
We know some things.

00:55:01.390 --> 00:55:03.560
Symmetry’s a big one, but there’s a bunch
of other ones too.

00:55:03.560 --> 00:55:04.560
I was just wondering how that would correlate
with - I know attraction to smells also has

00:55:04.560 --> 00:55:10.050
to do with your optimal mate.

00:55:10.050 --> 00:55:18.380
Oh yeah, there’s a bunch of things.

00:55:18.380 --> 00:55:21.830
Here's another study - this is a cool one.

00:55:21.830 --> 00:55:24.500
This is one of the few psychological facts.

00:55:24.500 --> 00:55:26.630
We don't have many psychological facts, you
know.

00:55:26.630 --> 00:55:31.680
We have a lot of hypotheses about things but
this is as close to a fact as we've ever got.

00:55:31.680 --> 00:55:37.940
So, back decades ago, these Israeli children
were raised in kibbutzim, and those were basically

00:55:37.940 --> 00:55:43.780
- they were basically daycare for kids.

00:55:43.780 --> 00:55:44.780
Group day care.

00:55:44.780 --> 00:55:49.119
But the kids were more separated from the
parents than they might be in a regular day

00:55:49.119 --> 00:55:50.119
care.

00:55:50.119 --> 00:55:54.930
Anyways, all the Israeli kids were in these
kibbutzim, and so then we have detailed marriage

00:55:54.930 --> 00:55:57.130
records of the kids.

00:55:57.130 --> 00:56:02.530
You know that people very seldom marry their
siblings, and they're very seldomly in a sexual

00:56:02.530 --> 00:56:05.740
relationship with their siblings, and you
might say well why is that.

00:56:05.740 --> 00:56:11.490
It’s the case across cultures, with very
specific exceptions like often high rank nobility

00:56:11.490 --> 00:56:14.609
- they have an option.

00:56:14.609 --> 00:56:20.820
Generally speaking, there's a powerful incest
taboo, as well as between parents and children.

00:56:20.820 --> 00:56:27.120
So, some researcher decided well how do you
