00:56:55.750 --> 00:56:57.490
It’s probably smell.

00:56:57.490 --> 00:56:58.740
That would be my guess.

00:56:58.740 --> 00:57:03.320
Now, there’s also another study.

00:57:03.320 --> 00:57:09.529
One of the things they found with mice - I
